      "statement": "SkillForgeGateway.list() returns { items: [] } when the skill root does not exist or cannot be read, and sorts the returned items by name with localeCompare; each item's content is read from <name>/SKILL.md and its frontmatter parsed, with a read failure producing a bare { name, title: name, description: '' } fallback item.",
